          "help": {
            "key": "settings.home.server.help",
            "text": "Direct messages and group chats use cmux Cloud by default. A self-hosted server is reached over Tailscale by its MagicDNS name, for example http://mini.tail1234.ts.net:7320. No password is sent: the server knows you by your Tailscale login."
